title: "Kubernetes Deployment Architecture"
---

flowchart TB

    INTERNET["Internet"]

    INGRESS["Ingress Controller"]

    GATEWAY["Gateway Deployment"]

    SERVICES["Microservice Deployments"]

    REALTIME["Realtime Stateful Deployment"]

    NATS["NATS Cluster"]

    REDIS["Redis Cluster"]

    PG["PostgreSQL"]

    INTERNET --> INGRESS

    INGRESS --> GATEWAY

    GATEWAY --> SERVICES
    GATEWAY --> REALTIME

    SERVICES --> NATS
    REALTIME --> NATS

    SERVICES --> REDIS
    REALTIME --> REDIS

    SERVICES --> PG